<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Renong 9-mth net 260.15 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Renong 9-mth net 260.15 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 260.15   vs	 192.73</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 12.0    vs	  11.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		   603.70   vs	 355.23</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   405.17   vs	 283.35</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 50.22   vs  less  39.88</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     -     vs	 138.25</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	  -     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Renong Bhd is an infrastructure developer.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
